OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pauses fridge recycling
OL,4,Aamid backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has urged residents to avoid
OL,7,Ftaking fridges and freezers to its four
OL,8,Frecycling centres while it deals with a
OL,9,Fbacklog.
OL,11,FCentral Bedfordshire Council said it
OL,12,Fcould not send the appliances to
OL,13,Falternative facilities during planned
OL,14,Fmaintenance work due to a national
OL,15,Fissue.
OL,17,FThe council hoped the backlog would be
OL,18,Fcleared and a normal service would
OL,19,Fresume from 12 October.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
