OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pauses fridge recycling
OL,4,Aamid backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracey Wye, the council's executive
OL,7,Fmember for sustainability and climate
OL,8,Fresilience, said: "This is a minor
OL,9,Fpause in our usual service, and we'd
OL,10,Flike to thank residents for their
OL,11,Fpatience while the recycling facility
OL,12,Fcompletes this work and clears the
OL,13,Fbacklog."
